{"version":1,"content":"<p>員工為遊玩《GTA6》申請休假，預計將給英國企業造成約1200萬英鎊損失。員工缺勤追蹤平台BrightHR的數據顯示，約8.3萬名英國員工在11月至12月申請休假時明確提到了這款遊戲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585680.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.292963+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T23:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"17274b43bfc3fc72742302628daddd1c975670709b010a4a5d674032e00a8a37","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}